<title>AUSTRIA: UAE's Rakad says supports OPEC output rollover.</title>
<headline>UAE's Rakad says supports OPEC output rollover.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>OPEC President and acting UAE oil minister Rakad bin Salem bin Rakad said on Tuesday that he supported an OPEC output rollover.</p>
<p>&quot;We will maintain the ceiling, sure,&quot; he told reporters.</p>
</text>
